      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 556526919,
      "version": 1389,
      "versionNonce": 250773671,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792327235188,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Scan Infix from left to right .\n\n2. Proceed exactly as before untill an opening bracmket arrives .\n\n3. As soon as an opening bracket arrives push it in the stack and proceed normally .\n\n4. Also push the first operator which arrives after opening bracket .\n\n5. Now again proceed normally untill you get a closing bracket .\n\n6. A soon as you get a closing bracket :\n \n a. Start popping all the operators from Stack and copy them in a postfix String .\n\n b. Stop as soon as a opening bracket is popped .\n\n c. Discard both the opening and closing bracket and proceed normally .\n\n7. If you get an opening bracket again then goto step 3.\n\n8. Finally when the expression ends pop all the operators from stack and copy them in postfix String .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Scan Infix from left to right .\n\n2. Proceed exactly as before untill an opening bracmket arrives .\n\n3. As soon as an opening bracket arrives push it in the stack and proceed normally .\n\n4. Also push the first operator which arrives after opening bracket .\n\n5. Now again proceed normally untill you get a closing bracket .\n\n6. A soon as you get a closing bracket :\n \n a. Start popping all the operators from Stack and copy them in a postfix String .\n\n b. Stop as soon as a opening bracket is popped .\n\n c. Discard both the opening and closing bracket and proceed normally .\n\n7. If you get an opening bracket again then goto step 3.\n\n8. Finally when the expression ends pop all the operators from stack and copy them in postfix String .",
